{"title":"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SpreadTheMathLove\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A haunted house has six windows. In how many ways can\nGeorgie the Ghost enter the house by one window and leave\nby a different window?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/d/3ad0f3be6f4a6a9ce92fd5206a130c21c7af5aff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 12 \\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ 15 \\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 18 \\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 30 \\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"387\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Georgie can enter the haunted house through any of the six windows. Then, he can leave through any of the remaining five windows.\n</p><p>So, Georgie has a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/3/573c9cf1b2d21773562e1043010bb61093ce8463.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 \\cdot 5$\" width=\"30\" height=\"12\" /> ways he can enter the house by one window and leave\nby a different window.\n</p><p>Therefore, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/c/7fc38e9b6f2d6c4263bd48804a9221fac4d57df9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 30}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"65\" height=\"28\" /> ways.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_SpreadTheMathLove\">Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=omFpSGMWhFc\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=omFpSGMWhFc</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/XdnS_5KEx6s\">https://youtu.be/XdnS_5KEx6s</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8\" title=\"2007 AMC 8\">2007 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2007\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3